{"id":"7afa0fc0e2492bbf","group":"62","path":"62/62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index.md","title":"ATR0 and Indices of Trees with at Most One Path","display":"thm-ATR0-unique-path-index — ATR0 and Indices of Trees with at Most One Path","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)","book_abbrev":"62","label":"62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index","aliases":["62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index"],"display":"thm-ATR0-unique-path-index — ATR0 and Indices of Trees with at Most One Path","depends_on":["[[62-df-RCA0]]","[[62-df-ATR0]]","[[62-df-Tree]]","[[62-df-coded-function]]","[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]"],"source":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem V.5.2; Lemmas V.5.3–V.5.4","source_pages":[191,192],"source_pdf_pages":[209,210]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Subsystems of Second Order Arithmetic (Simpson)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"62"},{"key":"label","html":"62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-ATR0-unique-path-index — ATR0 and Indices of Trees with at Most One Path"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source","html":"Simpson, 2nd edition (2009), Theorem V.5.2; Lemmas V.5.3–V.5.4"},{"key":"source_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>191</span><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>209</span><span>210</span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>理论见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"dd5e8930337c8b20\" href=\"?note=dd5e8930337c8b20\" title=\"62-df-RCA0\">62-df-RCA0</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"cfaecdc022e51c90\" href=\"?note=cfaecdc022e51c90\" title=\"62-df-ATR0\">62-df-ATR0</a>；Tree、Path 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"bb825000fd9a8272\" href=\"?note=bb825000fd9a8272\" title=\"62-df-Tree\">62-df-Tree</a>；截面和函数外延等号见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"c156c03daff0aff0\" href=\"?note=c156c03daff0aff0\" title=\"62-df-coded-function\">62-df-coded-function</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\">\\(\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"781620ab41bfeebd\" href=\"?note=781620ab41bfeebd\" title=\"62-df-equivalence-over-base\">62-df-equivalence-over-base</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UPI}\">\\(\\mathrm{UPI}\\)</span> 是下式的单个句子。</p>\n<p>上游理论为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\">\\(\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ATR0\\text{-}unique\\text{-}path\\text{-}index}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UPI}\\coloneqq\\forall C\\bigl[(&amp;\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\land\\forall i\\forall f,g[(\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f)\\land\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,g))\\to f=g])\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ATR0\\text{-}unique\\text{-}path\\text{-}index}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UPI}\\coloneqq\\forall C\\bigl[(&amp;\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\land\\forall i\\forall f,g[(\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f)\\land\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,g))\\to f=g])\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\{\\mathrm{UPI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\{\\mathrm{UPI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>V.5.2 的唯一见证理解刻画给出正向。反向首先用仅可能有恒零路径、并检查给定函数是否遗漏 i 的树恢复单射值域存在，即 ACA₀；然后原文 V.5.3–V.5.4 将唯一算术见证化为唯一树路径，结合各初始段递归结果的唯一性恢复 ATR。必须保留“每棵至多一条路径”前提；删除它后原则升为 Π¹₁-CA₀。</p>\n<p>来源：第二版（2009），Theorem V.5.2; Lemmas V.5.3–V.5.4；纸面页 191, 192；PDF 页 209, 210。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-RCA0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-ATR0]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-Tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-coded-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-RCA0","status":"resolved","id":"dd5e8930337c8b20","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-ATR0","status":"resolved","id":"cfaecdc022e51c90","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-Tree","status":"resolved","id":"bb825000fd9a8272","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-coded-function","status":"resolved","id":"c156c03daff0aff0","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。","embed":false},{"target":"62-df-equivalence-over-base","status":"resolved","id":"781620ab41bfeebd","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"理论见 [[62-df-RCA0]]、[[62-df-ATR0]]；Tree、Path 见 [[62-df-Tree]]；截面和函数外延等号见 [[62-df-coded-function]]；$\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}$ 见 [[62-df-equivalence-over-base]]。$\\mathrm{UPI}$ 是下式的单个句子。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UPI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RCA}_0,\\mathrm{ATR}_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}ATR0\\text{-}unique\\text{-}path\\text{-}index}\\vdash\\;\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{UPI}\\coloneqq\\forall C\\bigl[(&\\forall i\\;\\mathsf{Tree}((C)_i)\\land\\forall i\\forall f,g[(\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f)\\land\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,g))\\to f=g])\\\\\n&\\to\\exists X\\forall i(i\\in X\\leftrightarrow\\exists f\\;\\mathsf{Path}((C)_i,f))\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{EquivOver}_{S_2}(\\mathrm{ATR}_0,\\{\\mathrm{UPI}\\};\\mathrm{RCA}_0).","display":true}],"bytes":1950,"backlinks":[{"id":"c68a6ecbed6addff","anchor":"ref-80","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[62-thm-ATR0-unique-path-index|ATR0 and Indices of Trees with at Most One Path]]"}],"outgoing":["dd5e8930337c8b20","cfaecdc022e51c90","bb825000fd9a8272","c156c03daff0aff0","781620ab41bfeebd"]}